issue_context.body:
In looking at the Ingress API, I checked validation and I don't see any on the .spec.tls.secretName.  See https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/2b091f60ca09d3d03923a26b7cd02fb3dc6c47e2/pkg/apis/networking/validation/validation.go#L235-L254

I would expect at least some validation.  The secretName field does not indicate that it is a kubernetes secret, so if the intent is to allow any string, the godoc should probably be made explicit that clients need to defend themselves against path traversal if necessary.  And we probably want a max length at least.

@kubernetes/sig-network-bugs 
@liggitt @robscott
